councilTaxResponsible.no = No
councilTaxResponsible.actingFor = I am acting for someone who is responsible
councilTaxResponsible.hint = Only People who are responsible for the Council Tax on this property have permission to view more details. This includes people acting for someone who is responsible.
councilTaxResponsible.actingFor.hint = You will need their written permission
site.warning = Warning
