requestCouncilTaxBandReview.title = Request a Council Tax band review
requestCouncilTaxBandReview.heading = Request a Council Tax band review
requestCouncilTaxBandReview.p1.1 = You can ask the VO (Valuation Office) for a Council Tax band review at any time.
requestCouncilTaxBandReview.p1.2 = There is no charge for this service
requestCouncilTaxBandReview.p1.3 = You will need to tell us why you think the band should be reviewed. We may ask you for more details, and you may be required to provide evidence to support your request.
requestCouncilTaxBandReview.subheading1 = When you can request a Council Tax band review

requestCouncilTaxBandReview.p2.1 =You can request a review of your Council Tax band if:
requestCouncilTaxBandReview.subheading2.bullet1 = you became the new taxpayer within the last 6 months
requestCouncilTaxBandReview.subheading2.bullet2 = the council tax band has changed in the last 6 months
requestCouncilTaxBandReview.subheading2.bullet3 = the local area has physically changed
requestCouncilTaxBandReview.p2.2 = You can also request a review if something has changed. For example the property;
requestCouncilTaxBandReview.subheading2.bullet4 = has been demolished
requestCouncilTaxBandReview.subheading2.bullet5 = property is derelict and cannot be lived in
requestCouncilTaxBandReview.subheading2.bullet6 = is undergoing major renovations or repairs
requestCouncilTaxBandReview.subheading2.bullet7 = is partly used for business
requestCouncilTaxBandReview.subheading2.bullet8 = has been split into multiple properties or merged into one
requestCouncilTaxBandReview.p2.3 = If you request a review for one of these reasons, but don't agree with the outcome, you can appeal the decision.
requestCouncilTaxBandReview.p2.4 = We will take any improvements into account when setting the new band, which could be higher than the previous one. The new band will usually take effect from the date the property becomes fit to live in again.

requestCouncilTaxBandReview.subheading2 = Contacting your Local Council
requestCouncilTaxBandReview.p3.1 = You should also check with your local council for advice and information about Council Tax. Visit your local council's website for more details.
requestCouncilTaxBandReview.subheading3 = Reviewing the band for any other reason
requestCouncilTaxBandReview.p4.1 = If none of the above apply, we will only review your band if you provide supporting evidence. Your request for a band review will be rejected without this.
requestCouncilTaxBandReview.p4.2 = You won't have any legal rights to appeal the outcome of a review.
requestCouncilTaxBandReview.readContent.label = I have read this page and want to continue
requestCouncilTaxBandReview.checkYourAnswersLabel = Request a Council Tax band review
requestCouncilTaxBandReview.error.required = Select requestCouncilTaxBandReview
requestCouncilTaxBandReview.change.hidden = RequestCouncilTaxBandReview

noPermission.title = You do not have permission to view more details
noPermission.heading = You do not have permission to view more details
noPermission.body = Only people who are responsible for the Council Tax on this property have permission to view more details. This includes people acting for someone who is responsible.
noPermission.backToPropertyDetails = Back to property details

reasonForReview.title = Why do you want to review your Council Tax band?
reasonForReview.heading = Why do you want to review your Council Tax band?
reasonForReview.band-is-wrong = I think my band is wrong
reasonForReview.changes-affected-property = Changes have affected the property
reasonForReview.band-is-wrong.hint = For example, you think your Council Tax band is too high, or you disagree with a recent band or effective date change. You can also ask for a review following a tribunal or court decision about a similar property.
reasonForReview.changes-affected-property.hint = For example, the property has been partly or completely demolished, is undergoing major building work or renovation and cannot be lived in. This can also include changes in the local area or a change in how the property is used.
reasonForReview.checkYourAnswersLabel = Why do you want to review your Council Tax band?
reasonForReview.error.required = Select reasonForReview
reasonForReview.change.hidden = ReasonForReview

